Taskmaster Earring - Dwarf Male	29	{"kind":"quest","title":"Taskmaster Earring","wikiPath":"/Taskmaster_Earring","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Crushbone","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"an elven slave","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Experience, Minor Items"}],"card":{"title":"Taskmaster Earring","lines":["Minimum Level: 14","Classes: All","Related Zones: Greater Faydark, Butcherblock Mountains, Kaladim, Felwithe","Related NPCs: Various, orc taskmaster"]},"links":["Crushbone","An elven slave","Greater Faydark","Butcherblock Mountains","Kaladim","Felwithe","Orc taskmaster","Brass Earring","Merchant Nildar","Merchant Iludarae","Leather Leggings","Leather Shoulderpads","Leather Boots","Leather Cloak","A Worn Rune","Guard Haldin","Bronze Two Handed Battle Axe","Dwarven Axe","Kalameky Darkfoam","Targ Shield","Niola Impholder","Gossamer Robe","Summoning Efficiency I","Guard Settine","Silver Amber Ring"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"an elven slave","text":"You killed the taskmaster?! Absolutely amazing! The orcs will be fighting among themselves for power now and I can disappear in the commotion. Thanks, friend! Take this for your deeds!"},{"npc":"Merchant Nildar","text":"My brother still lives? Thank you for this news. Please, take this with my deepest thanks."},{"npc":"an elven slave","text":"You killed the taskmaster?! Absolutely amazing! The orcs will be fighting among themselves for power now and I can disappear in the commotion. Thanks, friend! Take this for your deeds!"},{"npc":"Merchant Iludarae","text":"I have no words for the gratitude I feel. So many of our young ones have been captured by the filthy orcs. Please, take this for saving my sister."},{"npc":"a dwarven slave","text":"You killed the taskmaster?! Absolutely amazing! The orcs will be fighting among themselves for power now and I can disappear in the commotion. Thanks, friend! Take this for your deeds!"},{"npc":"Guard Haldin","text":"Eh, strapling? Ye got this from me ol' partner? Huh. Aye, I know what it means but ye're not hearin'. Here, take this. It was his but he's not needin' it now."},{"npc":"a dwarven slave","text":"You killed the taskmaster?! Absolutely amazing! The orcs will be fighting among themselves for power now and I can disappear in the commotion. Thanks, friend! Take this for your deeds!"},{"npc":"Kalameky Darkfoam","text":"Why, that..! Bah! Fine. Stupid as a newborn gob. He's not gonna get this, then. Hey, you might as well take it. It was gonna be his reward fer a job well done."},{"npc":"Niola Impholder","text":"What? Not as supposed? What can he... Well, that's all well and good. You, I assume, wish a reward for your 'valiant work'? Well, here you go, adventurer."},{"npc":"an elven slave","text":"You killed the taskmaster?! Absolutely amazing! The orcs will be fighting among themselves for power now and I can disappear in the commotion. Thanks, friend! Take this for your deeds!"},{"npc":"Guard Settine","text":"I.. but.. she.. You can take this. I guess I don't need it any more."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T05:22:13.020Z","outOfEra":false}
