tal Coin","Althele","Sionae","Braided Grass Amulet","Nuien","Teloa","Fleshbound Tome","Earth Stained Note","Ella Foodcrafter","Hardened Mixture","Surefall Glade","Merdan Fleetfoot","Ancient Pattern","Platinum Speckled Powder","Enchanted Clay","Runecrested Bowl","Alrik Farsight","Timorous Deep","Crushed Pot","Farios Elianos","Felwithe","Grocery List","Merchant Nora","Northern Felwithe","Bag of Provisions","Receipt","Wood Painting","A human skeleton","Frontier Mountains","Silver Chained Locket","Niera Farbreeze","Kinlo Strongarm","North Kaladim","Ancient Longsword","Softly glowing stone","Summoned: Firefly Globe","Resurrection","Venril Sathir Remains","Spirit of Venril Sathir","Foloal Stormforest","Warmly Glowing Stone","Usbak the Old","Refined Ancient Sword","Refined Mithril Blade","Jaeil the Wretched","Mairee Silentone","Erudin","Dwarven Smiths Hammer","Hammer of the Ancients","Small bit of Mithril Ore","Xanuusus","North Karana","Oasis","The Overthere","Levitate","Spirit of Wolf","Camouflage","Succor","Druid","Evacuate","Wizard","South Felwithe","Platinum speckled powder","Kaladim","Rogue","Skill Pick Lock","Muffin for Pandos"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Ella Foodcrafter","text":"Hi, hi. I've got a lot to do, many mouths to feed, some filthy goblins to smack. If you don't need me for something, please let me go back to my work. Karana watch over you."},{"npc":"Ella Foodcrafter","text":"Hmmm. I've been waiting for someone to bring me this. I'm sorry such a young one as you has taken up this task. Maybe the sky god blesses ya though. Aye, ya have that look in your eye. Our task is to focus the blessings of the gods and cleanse the filth from the land. I have two tasks for ya."},{"npc":"Ella Foodcrafter","text":"Well, ya ask before ya act. That's a good sign. What I need isn't easy to find. First, I need a mixture. Plain sounding enough but it's a special one. Cleanses the mind and focuses the earth's energies into a forest walker's mind. I don't know how to make it. I don't even know what it's called. I merely know it exists and we'll be needing it for our task. When ya do find how to make it ya can mix it in that bowl. Keep it when you're done, it's a good bowl."},{"npc":"Farios Elianos","text":"Why in the nine hells would I need a crushed pot? Perhaps I could use it to not hold water! Why did you even bother me with this? Are you mentally deficient? Apparently. Oh, well, you're just a servant boy. Well, then, we'll make you useful, if just a little. Take this shopping list and go get my groceries. Take it to Nora in the tavern. She'll know what I need."},{"npc":"Merdan Fleetfoot","text":"Yes Niera! Oh. Erm. Hi. I mean, uh. How are you?"},{"npc":"Foloal Stormforest","text":"I have heard whispers of new Iksar movements in the land. The name of Venril Sathir is on the scaled lips and sharp tongues of every cold blooded lizard in this place."},{"npc":"Mairee Silentone","text":"Yes, the ancient hammer. I heard something about that. Do you mind if I take a look at it?"},{"npc":"Faelin","text":"Didn't think I was gone for good, did you? We're that much closer to finishing this trial of our strength, thanks to you."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-10-28T05:39:25.516Z","outOfEra":true}
